WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 6fa29b9b2497fd71530e19dc3cd77eb6

00:00:00.159 --> 00:00:03.139
Habari, karibu kwenye Build with Jeremy. Nimefurahi

00:00:03.220 --> 00:00:05.379
sana kwa sehemu hii ya Jiki. Katika

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.099
miezi michache ijayo, nitakupeleka

00:00:07.159 --> 00:00:09.600
kwenye safari ambapo tutajenga pamoja. Nitapitia

00:00:09.639 --> 00:00:11.720
mfululizo wa miradi halisi ambayo

00:00:11.759 --> 00:00:14.159
ninaijenga kwa ajili yangu mwenyewe, na nitapitia

00:00:14.219 --> 00:00:17.680
kila hatua moja kwa moja nawe, nikifanya maamuzi,

00:00:17.819 --> 00:00:20.899
nikiongeza huduma mpya, nikirekebisha hitilafu, na wewe ukiwa

00:00:20.959 --> 00:00:23.679
nami muda wote. Pia nitakupa miradi

00:00:23.739 --> 00:00:26.340
ya kufanyia kazi, nikikupa violezo

00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:29.579
vya kuanzia na kukupa changamoto ya kuvipanua na kuviboresha,

00:00:29.619 --> 00:00:32.419
ukitumia kwa vitendo kila kitu ninachokufundisha.

00:00:33.719 --> 00:00:35.340
Nitaendesha mifululizo michache tofauti

00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:38.139
kwa wakati mmoja, na pia kuandaa vipindi vya maswali na majibu

00:00:38.239 --> 00:00:40.239
ambapo unaweza kunitumia maswali yako,

00:00:40.579 --> 00:00:43.060
kisha nitayachunguza hewani. Baadhi

00:00:43.099 --> 00:00:44.700
ya maudhui haya ni bure, lakini mengi

00:00:44.739 --> 00:00:46.799
yanapatikana kwa wanachama wa Premium pekee.

00:00:47.319 --> 00:00:48.419
Kwa hiyo ukipenda kuja kwenye

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:51.719
safari nzima, tafadhali boresha hadi Premium. Tumeweka

00:00:51.799 --> 00:00:55.020
bei ya Premium iwe nafuu sana popote

00:00:55.059 --> 00:00:58.319
unapoishi, na wanachama wa Premium ndio wanaowezesha Jiki

00:00:58.379 --> 00:01:01.359
kuwepo. Kwa hiyo asante mapema kwa kuunga mkono

00:01:01.439 --> 00:01:05.499
jukwaa dogo huru la elimu. Tunazindua

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:07.760
tarehe 11 Julai kwa kipindi cha kwanza cha moja kwa moja.

00:01:07.839 --> 00:01:09.679
Natumaini utajiunga nami. Tafadhali weka

00:01:09.720 --> 00:01:12.059
kikumbusho cha YouTube kwa kubofya viungo

00:01:12.099 --> 00:01:13.599
kwenye ratiba. Tuonane wakati huo.
